note: locale.conf should use C.UTF-8 for specific categories
begin:
generator: <<RAKU
!raku
print q:c«
regexp: ^^ LC_COLLATE\= C\.UTF\-8 \s* $$
regexp: ^^ LC_CTYPE\= C\.UTF\-8 \s* $$
regexp: ^^ LC_MESSAGES\= C\.UTF\-8 \s* $$
regexp: ^^ LC_NUMERIC\= C\.UTF\-8 \s* $$
regexp: ^^ LANG\= {config()<locale>} \. UTF\-8 \s* $$
»
RAKU
end:
